# Baseline B-20 (F-47): a node result encodes as the Bolt 4.4 Node
# structure 0x4E [id, labels, properties]. "*" is a wildcard only as a map
# value, not as a structure field, so the id is pinned: it is the one this
# script's own fresh :memory: server assigns its first node.
!: BOLT 4.4
!: AUTO HELLO
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: RUN "CREATE (n:BoltProbe {name: 'a', k: 1}) RETURN n" {} {}
   PULL {"n": -1}
S: SUCCESS {}
   RECORD [{"#4E": [0, ["BoltProbe"], {"k": 1, "name": "a"}]}]
   SUCCESS {}
